msgid "Host bridge"
msgstr "主機橋接器"

msgid ""
"Host bridge attaches VMs on this network directly to an existing bridge "
"device, giving them LAN visibility. Private NAT creates an isolated internal"
" network with outbound internet access via NAT; VMs on it aren't directly "
"reachable from the LAN."
msgstr ""
"主機橋接器將此網路上的 VM 直接連接到一個現有的橋接裝置，使它們能夠看見區域網路。私用 NAT 創建一個隔離的內部網絡，透過 NAT "
"向外取用網際網路；該網路上的 VM 無法直接從區域網路存取。"

msgid ""
"How long Stop and Restart wait for the guest to shut down cleanly (sent "
"Ctrl+Alt+Del) before stopping it hard. 0 always stops hard. x86_64 hosts "
"only; on aarch64 Stop is always hard. Force stop never waits."
msgstr ""

