msgid ""
"Keep console=ttyS0 — removing it (or pointing it elsewhere) silences the "
"guest's serial console. The VM will still boot and run fine, but the Console"
" log and the cterm terminal will show nothing."
msgstr ""
"保留 console=ttyS0 － 移除它（或將其指向其他位置）會使 VM 客體的串列控制台靜默。VM 仍可正常啟動和執行，但控制台日誌和 cterm"
" 終端機將不顯示任何內容。"

