msgid ""
"Restoring a snapshot stops the VM, permanently overwrites its current disk "
"with the selected snapshot's saved disk, and boots from the snapshot's saved"
" memory state if it has one. Any changes made since the snapshot was taken "
"will be lost. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"復原快照會停止 "
"VM，將目前磁碟永久地以所選快照的儲存磁碟來覆蓋，若存在快照儲存的記憶體狀態，則將從該記憶體狀態啟動。自建立快照以後所做的任何更改都將丟失。是否繼續？"

msgid "Restoring backup ..."
msgstr "復原備份中 ..."

msgid "Restoring snapshot ..."
msgstr "復原快照中 ..."

msgid ""
"Restoring stops the target VM, permanently overwrites its current disk with "
"this backup's saved disk, and boots from the backup's saved memory state if "
"it has one (only when restoring onto the VM the backup was taken from). Any "
"changes made since the backup was taken will be lost. Continue?"
msgstr ""

