msgstr "為此網路運行 DHCP"

msgid "Run in jailer"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Runs Firecracker through its jailer — chrooted, as its own unprivileged "
"user, with only this VM's kernel, disks and network device inside. The VM's "
"disk images are handed over to that user, so their owner changes to a "
"numeric uid. Can only be changed while the VM is stopped. Warm snapshots and"
" backups only restore with the setting they were taken with."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Runs a DHCP and DNS server on the network's gateway address. Each VM keeps "
"the fixed address it is always given via its kernel command line; this also "
"hands that same address, and the gateway as DNS server, to guests that run a"
" DHCP client. VMs without a MAC address set get a fixed one derived from "
"their name. Applies to VMs as they start."
msgstr ""

